.500" end="01:08.710">you're </span><span begin="01:08.710" end="01:09.580">falling</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.580" end="01:12.490"><span begin="01:09.580" end="01:09.760">With </span><span begin="01:09.760" end="01:09.970">your </span><span begin="01:09.970" end="01:10.540">feet </span><span begin="01:10.540" end="01:11.260">still </span><span begin="01:11.260" end="01:11.620">on </span><span begin="01:11.620" end="01:11.920">the </span><span begin="01:11.920" end="01:12.490">ledge</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:12.550" end="01:14.110"><span begin="01:12.550" end="01:13.000">I'm </span><span begin="01:13.000" end="01:13.390">all </span><span begin="01:13.390" end="01:13.570">out </span><span begin="01:13.570" end="01:13.750">of </span><span begin="01:13.750" end="01:14.110">breath</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:14.200" end="01:17.470"><span begin="01:14.200" end="01:14.770">Baby</span><span begin="01:14.770" end="01:14.770">, </span><span begin="01:14.770" end="01:15.130">don't </span><span begin="01:15.130" end="01:15.610">run </span><span begin="01:15.610" end="01:16.240">me </span><span begin="01:16.240" end="01:16.660">'round </span><span begin="01:16.660" end="01:16.960">and </span><span begin="01:16.960" end="01:17.470">'round</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:17.500" end="01:20.590"><span begin="01:17.500" end="01:17.950">Don't </span><span begin="01:17.950" end="01:18.310">kiss </span><span begin="01:18.310" end="01:18.520">me</span><span begin="01:18.520" end="01:18.520">, </span><span begin="01:18.520" end="01:18.730">no</span><span begin="01:18.730" end="01:18.730">, </span><span begin="01:18.730" end="01:19.240">don't </span><span begin="01:19.240" end="01:19.600">kiss </span><span begin="01:19.600" end="01:19.810">me </span><span begin="01:19.810" end="01:20.110">right </span><span begin="01:20.110" end="01:20.590">now</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:20.980" end="01:23.140"><span begin="01:20.980" end="01:21.160">On </span><span begin="01:21.160" end="01:21.310">your </span><span begin="01:21.310" end="01:21.610">lips</span><span begin="01:21.610" end="01:21.610">, </span><span begin="01:21.610" end="01:21.940">just </span><span begin="01:21.940" end="01:22.300">leave </span><span begin="01:22.300" end="01:23.140">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:23.440" end="01:25.600"><span begin="01:23.440" end="01:23.800">If </span><span begin="01:23.800" end="01:24.040">you </span><span begin="01:24.040" end="01:24.370">don't </span><span begin="01:24.370" end="01:24.820">mean </span><span begin="01:24.820" end="01:25.600">it</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:25.960" end="01:26.950"><span begin="01:25.960" end="01:26.590">Oh</span><span begin="01:26.590" end="01:26.590">, </span><span begin="01:26.590" end="01:26.950">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:27.160" end="01:31.180"><span begin="01:27.160" end="01:27.340">You </span><span begin="01:27.340" end="01:27.670">know </span><span begin="01:27.670" end="01:27.940">you </span><span begin="01:27.940" end="01:28.330">got </span><span begin="01:28.330" end="01:28.630">me </span><span begin="01:28.630" end="01:29.020">in </span><span begin="01:29.020" end="01:29.140">the </span><span begin="01:29.140" end="01:29.620">palm </span><span begin="01:29.620" end="01:29.740">of </span><span begin="01:29.740" end="01:29.890">your </span><span begin="01:29.890" end="01:31.180">hand</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:31.420" end="01:33.280"><span begin="01:31.420" end="01:31.690">But </span><span begin="01:31.690" end="01:31.810">I </span><span begin="01:31.810" end="01:32.080">love </span><span begin="01:32.080" end="01:32.590">those </span><span begin="01:32.590" end="01:33.280">hands</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:34.270" end="01:37.030"><span begin="01:34.270" end="01:35.800">Oh</span><span begin="01:35.800" end="01:35.800">, </span><span begin="01:35.800" end="01:37.030">yeah</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:37